Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(app): the multiaxis-rough shank refusal now arrives
 with its ghost

#1015 gave the 5-axis stamp shank refusal a ghost, so GenerateOperation
returns CommandError::MachiningGhost, which reads as Machining. The test
matched Machining only; it now accepts the Machining family and pins that
the ghost is carried.

Refs #1015

